    "method": "Plugin API read of the file's local variable collections and text styles (HiFi Primitives, HiFi Color, HiFi Spacing, HiFi Radius; HiFi/*, Driver/* and Ops/* text styles).",
    "notes": [
      "The older 'SmartRail tokens' wireframe collection (monochrome, wireframe radii) is not part of the hi-fi identity and is not exported.",
      "Station type roles were reconciled to the live Station/* text styles on 2026-10-19. Explicit row/status/notice/hero script roles already include their measured line heights; do not apply another script multiplier.",
      "Driver/Phone/* text styles are the Driver tablet roles drawn at 3x, so they are not repeated here.",
      "T1 reconciled Figma tertiary colours and Noto Sans Display variants on 2026-10-19. The user then confirmed Abhaya Libre in both Figma and bundled app fonts; Sinhala references use its Regular face.",
      "Figma staff/status-success-ink, staff/status-warning-ink and staff/status-danger-ink mirror the Light Driver/Station profile overrides. Accent-coloured text on these Light surfaces uses text/primary; primary controls use nav/active and nav/active-ink."
    ]
  },

